SUMMARY:Board Game Night
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to kick off your weekend? Join us every Friday from 5 PM–9 PM for Game Night! Bring your favorite board game\, card game\, or tabletop game\, or choose from our growing collection of games available to play. Whether you’re a serious strategist\, a casual player\, or just looking to meet new people\, everyone is welcome. As a bonus\, all Game Night participants receive 10% off glasses during the event.
