UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfallfestivalatsouthmountaincreamery25902-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261002T161342Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Fall Festival at South Mountain Creamery
DESCRIPTION:Come spend a fall Saturday with us on the farm. Fall Fest is our free\, family-friendly festival\, and it's our favorite excuse to show off the whole working farm: free hayrides\, a petting zoo\, rolling tours of the production plant\, our tractors and equipment out on display\, live music all day\, and a costume contest for kids and pets. Grab a Fall Fest Sundae at the ice cream trailer\, browse the farmers market\, and bring a canned good or a warm coat for our SHIP donation drive while you're here. What's Happening: Free hayrides Petting zoo Rolling plant tours\, every 30 minutes Live music all day from Shade Tree Collective Costume contest for kids and pets Machinery Row\, our tractors and equipment on display Cornhole and yard games Farmers market and local artisans Hay bale photo booth Fall Fest Sundaes and Milkshakes
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/fall-festival-at-south-mountain-creamery/25902/
END:VEVENT
